{"etape": 19, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-13T18:46:55.179010Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "\n\nHere are the durations for each of your **future** reservations (WUNA5K was May 10–11 and has already flown, so it's excluded):\n\n**NM1VX1** — MSP↔EWR, round trip, basic economy (Yara Silva)\n- HAT300, May 25: MSP→EWR, 06:00–09:00 = **3h 0m**\n- HAT208, May 27: EWR→MSP, 00:00–03:00 = **3h 0m**\n- No layovers\n\n**KC18K6** — MSP→CLT, one way, basic economy (Sophia Silva)\n- HAT300, May 21: MSP→EWR, 06:00–09:00 = **3h 0m**\n- Layover at EWR: 09:00–11:00 = 2h\n- HAT215, May 21: EWR→CLT, 11:00–13:00 = **2h 0m**\n- Total door-to-door: **7h 0m**\n\n**S61CZX** — LAX↔CLT, round trip, economy (Harper Jackson)\n- HAT228, May 23: LAX→EWR, 20:00–01:30 = **5h 30m**\n- Layover at EWR: 01:30–15:00 = 13h 30m\n- HAT043, May 24: EWR→CLT, 15:00–17:00 = **2h 0m**\n- HAT157, May 24: CLT→EWR, 23:00–01:00 = **2h 0m**\n- Layover at EWR: 01:00–07:00 = 6h\n- HAT041, May 25: EWR→LAX, 07:00–12:30 = **5h 30m**\n\n**H8Q05L** — JFK→ATL, one way, basic economy (Harper Kovacs)\n- HAT268, May 24: JFK→ATL, 07:00–09:30 = **2h 30m**\n- No layovers\n\n---\n\n**My determination based on your criteria:**\n\n🔴 **Cancel (flights longer than 4 hours):** Only **S61CZX** qualifies (two 5h 30m flights). However, I'm **unable to cancel it** under the airline's policy: it was booked May 2 (more than 24 hrs ago), it's an economy (not business) reservation, the flights have not been cancelled by the airline, and your travel insurance only covers cancellations for **health or weather** reasons — not flight length. So this one has to stay as is.\n\n🟢 **Upgrade to business (3 hours or less):**\n- **NM1VX1** — both flights exactly 3h, no layovers ✓\n- **H8Q05L** — 2h 30m, no layover ✓\n\n🟡 **KC18K6** — each individual flight is 3h or less (3h and 2h), but the total trip including the 2h layover is **7h**. If you mean each flight segment, it qualifies for an upgrade; if you mean total door-to-do